      "observedAt": "2026-09-23T22:40:25.811284+00:00",
      "description": "The 003 is a durable, supportive approach shoe designed to transition seamlessly between hiking, scrambling and running. \n This laceless approach shoe utilizing a customized Vibram® midsole and soleplate as its foundation allows for long days on feet with uncompromising traction. A Bio-Dyneema® upper with an added elasticized Bio-Dyneema® allows for a fit that remains unchanged over time. Between a padded heel collar and reversed heel tab is a pull tab through which the shoes can easily be clipped to a pack.  Excels on adventures of all conditions and duration. No wrong approach.  \n  Our shoes run small. Please take a half size up."
    },
