      "canonicalURL": "https://renegade-running.com/products/mens-055-strato",
      "sourceURL": "https://renegade-running.com/products/mens-055-strato?variant=52207688384813",
      "observedAt": "2026-09-23T22:40:27.111661+00:00",
      "description": "The norda 055 combines race day grade resilience and responsiveness with a build that’s designed to tackle the world’s most technical terrain. Its one-piece knit “sock” collar — a first for norda footwear — supplies a “second skin” fit to keep trail detritus out and the wearer’s foot locked in place, while a bespoke Arnitel® midsole ensures benchmark rebound and stable mechanical properties across all conditions and climates. \n \n \n \n \n \n Fit Guide: We recommend to go up 1/2 size (US) from your regular size."
    },
